# Testimony Of Glory (Q220), the chiefs' trophies: a level 38 Orc Raider at cond 4 holding Chianta's order, Voltar's, Kepra's and Burai's gloves and the scepters of Vuku and Tunath
# kills Pashika and Vultus (the second takes the glove back) and shows both heads to Voltar for the scepter of Breka, kills four Enku orc overlords and shows the
# heads to Kepra for the scepter of Enku, kills two Makum bugbear thugs and shows the heads to Burai for the scepter of Turek, which completes the four and sets cond 5.
# Every script roll is pinned to 1. The privates the chiefs call are not played here (a scenario cannot show a script-spawned NPC): a Boot test plays them.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
